between any two vertices in the set is at most 3. Therefore, if the radius is at least 4 and the roman weight equals 4, there's a contradiction, since the radius would be at most 3. If they are adjacent the radius is at most 2.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"\"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_e20263a9/scratch_rdn.lean\"","StartLine":"1","toolAction":"\"Viewing file\"","toolSummary":"\"View scratch_rdn.lean\""}}]}
